# Verify the BLE Page Turner fix (NimBLE two-host strip, see plans/019).
# Pre-fix this path panicked at NimBLEDevice::init with npl_freertos_mutex_pend;
# post-fix it must reach "Page Turner advertising started" with no error markers.
#
# Navigation mirrors ble_crash_repro.walk (same unit: Pokémon-party grid home,
# Settings -> Net tab -> BLE Page Turner). If the home layout/SD state differs,
# the button counts drift -- prefer CMD:launch_activity once that lands (plan 020).
#
#   uv run python scripts/device_walk.py run scripts/walks/ble-page-turner-verify.walk --outdir runs/ble-verify
#
# Pass criteria: the 'expect' below matches AND run_walk reports no error markers
# (the harness fails the run if it sees [ERR]/Backtrace/Guru Meditation/panic).

press BACK 3
# Home grid -> drop into the action/toolbar row -> Settings (sliders) icon
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
press RIGHT 1
press RIGHT 1
press RIGHT 1
shot 01-settings-focus
# Enter Settings, advance to the Net category
press CONFIRM 2
press CONFIRM 1
press CONFIRM 1
press CONFIRM 2
shot 02-net-tab
# Into the list: Wi-Fi Networks -> BLE Page Turner, then activate
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
shot 03-ble-selected
press CONFIRM 1
# The fix's success contract: advertising comes up instead of an NPL panic.
expect 15 Page Turner advertising started
shot 04-ble-advertising
